iv class=\"nhead\">板・売買フローの推定（AI）</div><div class=\"discnote\">この銘柄は本日の分析対象外です（今夜の厳選・出尽くしサイン・レーティング変化・注目開示などの注目銘柄のみ、毎晩の実行で場中の5分足を取得して分析します）。</div><div class=\"spwrap\"><div class=\"nhead\">値動きと長期支持帯<span class=\"spbtns\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"spbtn\" onclick=\"spSwap(this, '1')\">1年</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"spbtn on\" onclick=\"spSwap(this, '3')\">3年</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"spbtn\" onclick=\"spSwap(this, '10')\">10年</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"spbtn\" onclick=\"spSwap(this, 'all')\">全期間(20年)</button></span></div><div class=\"spark spv\" data-sp=\"1\" style=\"display:none\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 320 110\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" style=\"width:100%; height:auto; background:#fffdf6; border-radius:8px;\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"48.7\" width=\"320\" height=\"4.599999999999994\" fill=\"#c62f2f\" opacity=\"0.12\"/><polyline points=\"4.0,78.3 9.1,82.8 14.2,81.4 19.3,80.2 24.5,83.0 29.6,82.6 34.7,82.3 39.8,84.8 44.9,85.6 50.0,90.9 55.1,94.0 60.3,90.8 65.4,94.5 70.5,93.7 75.6,93.6 80.7,93.9 85.8,94.0 91.0,94.5 96.1,94.5 101.2,91.6 106.3,94.5 111.4,97.2 116.5,96.9 121.6,94.6 126.8,72.4 131.9,53.0 137.0,31.8 142.1,12.8 147.2,22.9 152.3,46.9 157.4,55.2 162.6,54.2 167.7,52.1 172.8,41.3 177.9,47.5 183.0,46.9 188.1,38.9 193.2,30.9 198.4,21.4 203.5,14.6 208.6,18.3 213.7,18.6 218.8,26.6 223.9,35.2 229.0,30.0 234.2,18.9 239.3,26.6 244.4,28.4 249.5,27.5 254.6,24.7 259.7,34.6 264.9,32.7 270.0,36.1 275.1,34.9 280.2,30.6 285.3,35.8 290.4,35.2 295.5,37.3 300.7,44.7 305.8,46.9 310.9,50.2 316.0,30.6\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#1c1c1e\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/><path d=\"M 183.0 58.9 l 5 8 l -10 0 z\" fill=\"#c62f2f\"/><path d=\"M 264.9 44.7 l 5 8 l -10 0 z\" fill=\"#c62f2f\"/><circle cx=\"316.0\" cy=\"30.6\" r=\"4\" fill=\"#1c1c1e\"/></svg></div><div class=\"spark spv\" data-sp=\"3\" style=\"display:\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 320 110\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" style=\"width:100%; height:auto; background:#fffdf6; border-radius:8px;\">